  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">5 st&#xe4;der f&#xf6;rstudie VA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">5 towns FS, W&amp;WW, Latvia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xe5;let med studien &#xe4;r att utveckla en l&#xe5;ngsiktig plan (1999-2013) och en kortsiktig plan (1999-2003) f&#xf6;r finansiering av restaurering och utveckling av vatten- och avloppssystemet i fem lettiska st&#xe4;der utmed floden Daugava, Leilvarde, Kegums, Salaspils, Ogre och Kekava.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the study is to develop a plan for long term (1999-2013) and short term (1999-2003) investment and rehabilitation programmes of water and wastewater services in five small Latvian towns located along the River of Daugava, Leilvarde, Kegums, Salaspils, Ogre and Kekava.</narrative>
  </description>
